# TinyML Motion Recognition

ESP32-based TinyML project focused on motion recognition using inertial sensors.

## Current Status

* ESP32 communication established
* I2C communication verified
* Unknown IMU detected at address 0x68
* WHO_AM_I returns 0x72
* Accelerometer data acquisition operational

## Hardware

* ESP32 DOIT DevKit V1
* Unknown IMU (sold as MPU6050)

## Project Roadmap

1. Sensor characterization
2. Noise analysis
3. Signal filtering
4. Dataset generation
5. Feature extraction
6. TinyML model development
7. On-device inference

## Documentation

See `/docs` for technical reports and project notes.
